NOTE ON DATA

This licence covers the SOFTWARE ONLY. It does not cover, and cannot grant
rights to, any data the software collects or processes.

Data handled by this engine carries its own licences, which travel with every
record and must be honoured downstream:

  OpenStreetMap (via Geofabrik)  ODbL-1.0
    © OpenStreetMap contributors. Share-alike applies to derived databases.

  Overture Maps Places           CDLA-Permissive-2.0
    © Overture Maps Foundation. Attribution required.

  GeoNames postal codes          CC-BY-4.0
    © GeoNames. Attribution required.

  Telangana Open Data Portal     GODL-India
    Attribution required. Used for verification only.

Every export includes ATTRIBUTION.txt and a manifest listing the licences of
the records it contains. Consumers must display that attribution.
